      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I don&#39;t see the difference... both effects say &quot;The first time a [target type] would be dealt damage, redirect that damage to [card name].&quot;</p><p>In both cases the ambiguity arises from the meaning of the word &quot;a&quot; which can mean &quot;each&quot; or &quot;any&quot;. If this card is meant to be &quot;each&quot; I think it needs errata.</p>",
