      "id": 182846,
      "name": "Sonvar",
      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-09-24T14:06:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Provocator Tarnis with its wording only cares about the first time any other villain target than itself takes damage which is why it only triggers once. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Wrong Time and Place is not worded in that it cares about the first time any hero target would take damage. &nbsp;</p>",
