      "raw": "<p>Provocator Tarnis with its wording only cares about the first time any other villain target than itself takes damage which is why it only triggers once. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Wrong Time and Place is not worded in that it cares about the first time any hero target would take damage. &nbsp;</p>",
