      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "If Setback would be dealt damage in the video game (i.e. he is the original target of the damage) he cannot remove tokens from his unlucky pool to redirect that damage to a target. Is this a bug or how wrong time and place is supposed to work?  It seems like Setback should be able to redirect (if he has the tokens) since Setback is a hero target.",
