      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-09-27T21:17:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Can Synaptic Interruption redirect damage to Tachyon? &nbsp;What about Nightmist's Amulet? &nbsp;(I'm not being retorical here, I actually don't know)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If they can't, then presumably it is impossible to redirect damage to the original target, and Wrong Time and Place can't activate because it's trying to do something impossible. &nbsp;That said, if that is the intended behavior, it should be errataed (at least in the video game) to read \"other hero targets\" because that cleans up the ambiguity without adding significant verbiage.</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:07:56.852Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
